This application is an independent client for audio.cpp. It does NOT include
audio.cpp itself or any model weights; obtain them separately from their
upstream sources. Each model carries its own license.

Included third-party material:
- A local model-spec overlay (app/assets/model_specs_app), layered over the
  backend's model_specs and based on the official audio.cpp repository
  (© 2026 ShugoAI LLC, Apache-2.0). A copy of that upstream license is included
  at app/assets/licenses/audio.cpp-LICENSE.txt.
- The Microsoft Visual C++ Runtime (e.g. msvcp140.dll, vcruntime140.dll,
  vcruntime140_1.dll), redistributed app-locally under Microsoft's Distributable
  Code terms so the app runs without a separate Redistributable install.

